# Try the API from VS Code: install the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client),
# start the server (npm run dev), then click "Send Request" above any request below.
# Run "Sign in" first – the login cookie is remembered for the other requests.

@api = http://localhost:3000/api
@ym = 2026-10

### Health check (no login needed)
GET {{api}}/health

### Sign in – asks for your email and password
# @prompt email Your email
# @prompt password Your password
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}", "remember": true }

### Who am I
GET {{api}}/auth/me

### Everything for October 2026 (totals, bills, cards, people, sudden spends)
GET {{api}}/months/{{ym}}

### A month that doesn't exist yet – shows what it can roll over from
GET {{api}}/months/2026-11

### Change the budget
PATCH {{api}}/months/{{ym}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budget": 66000 }

### Add a bill
POST {{api}}/months/{{ym}}/bills
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Electricity", "category": "house", "amount": 1450, "dueDay": 12, "status": "unpaid" }

### Mark a bill paid – paste a bill "id" from the month view
PATCH {{api}}/bills/PASTE_BILL_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "paid" }

### Undo the last change – paste the "undoToken" from the previous response
POST {{api}}/undo/PASTE_UNDO_TOKEN

### Add a sudden spend
POST {{api}}/months/{{ym}}/sudden
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bike service", "amount": 2200, "mode": "UPI", "date": "2026-10-06" }

### Someone owes me
POST {{api}}/months/{{ym}}/people-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "direction": "in", "name": "Ravi · movie tickets", "amount": 450 }

### Cards, EMIs, plans, people
GET {{api}}/cards

###
GET {{api}}/emis

###
GET {{api}}/plans

###
GET {{api}}/people?at={{ym}}

### Installments, closing soonest first
GET {{api}}/installments?at={{ym}}

### Year view
GET {{api}}/years/2026

### Sign out
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
